---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
---
<GuideLayout 
  title="Mastering Lead Times: Solving Peak Season Production Bottlenecks"
  type="OPERATIONS"
  date="July 03, 2026"
  readTime="8 min read"
>
  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none font-['Century_Gothic',sans-serif] text-slate-800">
    <header class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">The Q3/Q4 Challenge</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
        For retail chains and seasonal brands, missing a launch date by even two weeks can result in millions in lost revenue. As the industry moves toward Q4, factory capacity becomes the most valuable currency in the activewear world.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">The Solution: Strategic Capacity Reservation</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
        Leading brands no longer wait for finalized designs to book factory space. They use <strong>Capacity Reservation Agreements (CRA)</strong>. This tactical shift allows FITCLO to lock in your production lines months in advance, regardless of design iterations.
      </p>

      <div class="bg-gold/5 border border-gold/20 rounded-xl p-8 mb-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Why Capacity Reservation Works:</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4 list-none p-0">
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-gold font-bold">01.</span>
            <span class="text-slate-700"><strong>Guaranteed Slot:</strong> Your production starts on the exact day agreed upon, bypassing the peak season queue.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-gold font-bold">02.</span>
            <span class="text-slate-700"><strong>Fabric Pre-positioning:</strong> We source yarns and base greige fabrics early, eliminating raw material delays.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="text-gold font-bold">03.</span>
            <span class="text-slate-700"><strong>Fixed Pricing:</strong> Lock in labor and overhead rates before the seasonal surge.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Our Tactical Lead Time Framework</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-100 border-collapse border border-slate-200 text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-slate-100">
              <th class="border border-slate-200 p-3 text-left">Phase</th>
              <th class="border border-slate-200 p-3 text-left">Timeline</th>
              <th class="border border-slate-200 p-3 text-left">Critical Action</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-slate-200 p-3 font-bold">Proto Sample</td>
              <td class="border border-slate-200 p-3">7-10 Days</td>
              <td class="border border-slate-200 p-3">Tech Pack Finalization</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-slate-200 p-3 font-bold">Salesman Samples</td>
              <td class="border border-slate-200 p-3">15-20 Days</td>
              <td class="border border-slate-200 p-3">Marketing Asset Creation</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-slate-200 p-3 font-bold">Bulk Production</td>
              <td class="border border-slate-200 p-3">35-45 Days</td>
              <td class="border border-slate-200 p-3">QC & Packaging</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-slate-900 text-white p-8 rounded-2xl mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Secure Your Q4 Production Slot</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-300 mb-6">Our September and October lines are filling up. Contact our planning department today to discuss reservation options.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="#inquiry" class="bg-[#C9A84C] text-black px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-[#b8973d] transition-colors">Check Capacity Schedule</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</GuideLayout>